  "details": "Patch notes mention this issue was resolved in Build 1151 but I am still encountering this issue with several friends. \n\nVideo: https://files.catbox.moe/27n0oe.mp4 \n\n\"- Fixed an issue where the Main Menu would \"remember\" where people you had joined previously, so you could join users in Ask Me status without requesting\n  \n- To clarify: this does not mean the bug let you \"get past\" orange status. It means that your VRChat would incorrectly \"remember\" if you saw them in your instance during the same session, and let you rejoin that instance. \"Ask Me\" or \"Orange\" status is handled on the server side, so other people don't have your location unless you gave it to them by inviting them or being in the same instance as them.\"",
